{
  "_doc": "perf_audit benchmark scenes (docs/PERF_AUDIT.md). setup: console lines run after the map loads (host). camera: spline keys [x, y, z, yaw deg (0 = -z), pitch deg] over the captured frames; orbit: a circle around the local player instead (maps without fixed coordinates). Every scene runs with the time paused, the weather locked, dev_fixed_fps 60 (one sim tick per frame: the same work in every run) and no vsync / frame cap.",
  "settle_frames": 120,
  "shots": 3,
  "_reset": "console lines run before every scene's setup: what a scene's setup may change that the others do not set",
  "reset": ["weather_clouds -1"],
  "_bench": "perf_bench (docs/PERF_AUDIT.md \"FPS benchmark\"): these scenes back to back on one load of map devroom_vegetation, in this order (dveg_horde last: its zombies stay); camera_ground: the camera keys' y (an orbit's height) is above the ground under the camera",
  "bench": ["dveg_hall", "dveg_overlook", "dveg_pine", "dveg_broadleaf", "dveg_meadow", "dveg_south", "dveg_horde"],
  "scenes": [
    {
      "id": "dveg_hall",
      "desc": "FPS benchmark: the dev room hall, post corner and firing line with the valley outside (the devroom route)",
      "map": "devroom_vegetation",
      "setup": ["time_set 15:00", "time_pause 1", "weather_lock 1", "weather_set little_cloudy 0", "setpos 0 0 20"],
      "camera_ground": true,
      "camera": [[0, 1.8, 20, 0, -3], [0, 2.0, 2, -30, -4], [-12, 1.8, -14, -57, -5], [-22, 1.8, -24, -90, -3], [-18, 3.0, -5, -180, -6], [-10, 4, 30, -200, -10], [0, 1.8, 20, -360, -3]]
